OL,3,GNEWSAHuge delays after lorry crashes
OL,4,Athrough M60 central barrier
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are facing huge delays as part
OL,7,Fof the M60 has been closed in both
OL,8,Fdirections after a lorry crossed the
OL,9,Fcentral reservation on to the opposite
OL,10,Fcarriageway.
OL,12,FNational Highways said the serious
OL,13,Fcrash happened at junction 15, where
OL,14,Fthe M60 meets the M61 near Swinton in
OL,15,FGreater Manchester.
OL,17,FGreater Manchester Police said the
OL,18,Fheavy goods vehicle hit the central
OL,19,Freservation safety barriers and leaked
OL,20,Ffuel. A spokesperson said nobody was
OL,21,Finjured in the incident.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
