OL,3,GNEWSAHuge delays after lorry crashes
OL,4,Athrough M60 central barrier
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers in the area have been warned of
OL,7,Fdelays of about an hour, with queues
OL,8,Fstretching seven miles (11km).
